{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "461449b1-0db5-4ad4-bb34-12b0eaa144b6",
    "name": "Parking · tariff-service",
    "description": "tariff-service — verificado contra `origin/release123` el 2026-07-23.\n\nTodos los endpoints de `TariffRestAdapter` estan implementados. Base path `/v1/tariffs`.\n\nTipos validos de `type`: `CAR`, `CAR_PMR`, `MOTORBIKE`.\n\nAvisos sobre el contrato:\n- `POST` usa `TariffCreateRequest` (`name`, `type`, `pricePerMinute`, `basePrice`,\n  `active`) y `PUT` usa `TariffUpdateRequest` (`name`, `pricePerMinute`,\n  `basePrice`): **el PUT no acepta `type` ni `active`**. El tipo no se cambia una\n  vez creada; el estado se cambia con el PATCH.\n- `pricePerMinute` debe ser > 0 y `basePrice` >= 0 (`@DecimalMin`).\n- `POST /v1/tariffs/calculate` — el que stay necesitaria en el check-OUT — **no\n  existe**. Tampoco `GET /v1/tariffs/current` ni `PATCH /{id}/deactivate`.\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Crear tarifa",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlTariff}}/v1/tariffs",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlTariff}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "tariffs"
          ]
        },
        "description": "POST /v1/tariffs -> 201 Created.\n\nTodos los campos son obligatorios. `pricePerMinute` > 0 estricto: un 0 devuelve 400.\n\nGuarda el id en `tariffId`.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Tarifa estandar coche\",\n  \"type\": \"{{vehicleType}}\",\n  \"pricePerMinute\": 0.05,\n  \"basePrice\": 1.0,\n  \"active\": true\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.environment.set('tariffId', body.id);",
              "pm.test('nace activa', () => pm.expect(body.active).to.be.true);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tarifas activas por tipo",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlTariff}}/v1/tariffs/active?type=CAR",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlTariff}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "tariffs",
            "active"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "type",
              "value": "{{vehicleType}}",
              "description": "CAR | CAR_PMR | MOTORBIKE (obligatorio)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "GET /v1/tariffs/active?type={vehicleType} -> 200 con la lista de tarifas activas de ese tipo.\n\n`type` es **obligatorio** (`@RequestParam` sin default): sin el, 400.\n\nEs el endpoint que stay-service usara para resolver el `tariffId` de la estancia cuando el adaptador real sustituya al `StubStayTariffAdapter`."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('devuelve un array', () => pm.expect(body).to.be.an('array'));",
              "if (body.length > 0) { pm.environment.set('tariffId', body[0].id); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Listar tarifas",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlTariff}}/v1/tariffs",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlTariff}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "tariffs"
          ]
        },
        "description": "GET /v1/tariffs -> 200 con todas las tarifas, activas o no."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Obtener tarifa por id",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlTariff}}/v1/tariffs/{{tariffId}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlTariff}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "tariffs",
            "{{tariffId}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "GET /v1/tariffs/{id} -> 200.\n\nNota de implementacion: `/active` se declara ANTES que `/{id}` en el controlador para que Spring no intente parsear 'active' como UUID."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Actualizar tarifa",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlTariff}}/v1/tariffs/{{tariffId}}",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlTariff}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "tariffs",
            "{{tariffId}}"
          ]
        },
        "description": "PUT /v1/tariffs/{id} -> 200.\n\nSolo `name`, `pricePerMinute` y `basePrice`. Mandar `type` o `active` aqui no hace nada: no estan en `TariffUpdateRequest`.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Tarifa estandar coche (revisada)\",\n  \"pricePerMinute\": 0.07,\n  \"basePrice\": 1.5\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('precio actualizado', () => pm.expect(Number(pm.response.json().pricePerMinute)).to.eql(0.07));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Desactivar tarifa",
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlTariff}}/v1/tariffs/{{tariffId}}/status",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlTariff}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "tariffs",
            "{{tariffId}}",
            "status"
          ]
        },
        "description": "PATCH /v1/tariffs/{id}/status -> 200.\n\n`{\"active\": false}` -> `DeactivateTariffUseCase`; `{\"active\": true}` -> `ActivateTariffUseCase`. A diferencia de vehicle, aqui el PATCH **si** lee el body.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"active\": false\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('queda inactiva', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().active).to.be.false);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Reactivar tarifa",
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlTariff}}/v1/tariffs/{{tariffId}}/status",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlTariff}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "tariffs",
            "{{tariffId}}",
            "status"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Misma ruta con `active: true`. Deja la tarifa lista para el siguiente pase de la coleccion.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"active\": true\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('vuelve a estar activa', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().active).to.be.true);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Pendiente de implementar",
      "description": "Rutas del openapi.yml sin controlador detras.",
